+
+`sortCore`: with `Z1` in `60004`, `Z2` in `60005`, `n` in `60006`, the item array `0 … n - 1` is
+built at the allocator and sorted by the lexicographic order of `(m (Z1 + i), m (Z2 + i))`; the
