-`241309 … 241315`:
-
-* inside a tour edge (`h > 0`): the edge `e` and its twin `tourTwin C (e - 6) + 6`;
-* at a tour vertex (`h = 0`) of the chain vertex `k`: the vertex holes of the candidates
-  `candIdx k + 6`, `candIdx (2m - k) + 6`, and of `2m + 6` if `k` is the top.
--/
